<title>USA: IPO FILING - Racing Champions Corp.</title>
<headline>IPO FILING - Racing Champions Corp.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name		 Racing Champions Corp</p>
<p>Stock symbol			RACN.O</p>
<p>Estimated price range	   $12-$14/shr</p>
<p>Total shares to be offered    5.0 million</p>
<p>Shrs offered by company	 5.0 million</p>
<p>Shrs outstanding after ipo    12,885,240</p>
<p>Lead Underwriter    Robert W. Baird &amp; Co Inc</p>
<p>Underwriters over-allotment  750,000 shrs</p>
<p>Business: Based in Glen Ellyn, Ill., Racing is a producer and marketer of collectible scaled die cast vehicle replicas.</p>
<p>Use of Proceeds: To redeem all of the company's outstanding shares of preferred stock to repay indebtedness to the company's current stockholders.</p>
</text>
